{"id":"455282","name":"冬瓜香菜汆丸子","author":"lengnina","authorId":"701321","desc":"","cover":"images/455282/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"冬瓜","amount":"500g"},{"name":"猪肉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"葱香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"白胡椒粉","amount":"适量"},{"name":"盐","amount":"适量"},{"name":"蚝油","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香油","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"冬瓜切厚片，香菜葱切段。","img":"images/455282/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"猪肉馅里加葱碎姜碎，蚝油，酱油，糖，鸡精，鸡蛋，熟油搅打上劲。","img":"images/455282/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"起锅烧水，水量稍多，水烧到起泡响边之后调小火力。","img":"images/455282/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"肉馅团成小丸子下入水里，丸子没有浮起之前不要搅动。","img":"images/455282/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"丸子浮起之后，用勺子打去浮沫。","img":"images/455282/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"放入一勺盐。","img":"images/455282/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒白胡椒粉。","img":"images/455282/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放入冬瓜片煮5分钟。","img":"images/455282/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放入葱和香菜。","img":"images/455282/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"香菜煮软放入少量香油。","img":"images/455282/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/455282/step_11.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：其他\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}